 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "Look at the window when you fly.",
   "s": 0.171,
   "e": 1.434
  },
  {
   "text": "It's round.",
   "s": 1.813,
   "e": 2.295
  },
  {
   "text": "That little curve is why the plane stays in one piece.",
   "s": 2.809,
   "e": 5.454
  },
  {
   "text": "Every jet is a metal balloon.",
   "s": 5.951,
   "e": 7.456
  },
  {
   "text": "Up high,",
   "s": 8.016,
   "e": 8.465
  },
  {
   "text": "the air is thin,",
   "s": 8.698,
   "e": 9.113
  },
  {
   "text": "so the cabin is pumped full of air to keep you breathing.",
   "s": 9.234,
   "e": 10.777
  },
  {
   "text": "That pressure pushes on the skin,",
   "s": 10.918,
   "e": 12.197
  },
  {
   "text": "over and over,",
   "s": 12.878,
   "e": 13.485
  },
  {
   "text": "every flight.",
   "s": 13.644,
   "e": 14.447
  },
  {
   "text": "Cut a square hole in that skin,",
   "s": 14.719,
   "e": 16.358
  },
  {
   "text": "and all the force piles up in the four sharp corners.",
   "s": 17.042,
   "e": 20.115
  },
  {
   "text": "Tiny cracks start there.",
   "s": 20.24,
   "e": 21.396
  },
  {
   "text": "And with every takeoff and landing,",
   "s": 22.122,
   "e": 25.268
  },
  {
   "text": "they grow.",
   "s": 25.52,
   "e": 25.966
  },
  {
   "text": "In 1954,",
   "s": 26.627,
   "e": 27.842
  },
  {
   "text": "two Comet jets broke apart in mid-air.",
   "s": 28.135,
   "e": 30.353
  },
  {
   "text": "The cracks had started at the corners of the square windows.",
   "s": 30.943,
   "e": 33.47
  },
  {
   "text": "So engineers changed the shape.",
   "s": 34.096,
   "e": 35.694
  },
  {
   "text": "No corners,",
   "s": 36.208,
   "e": 36.92
  },
  {
   "text": "no pile-up.",
   "s": 37.137,
   "e": 37.792
  },
  {
   "text": "The stress spreads smoothly around the curve.",
   "s": 38.438,
   "e": 40.748
  },
  {
   "text": "That's why every window today is round.",
   "s": 41.371,
   "e": 43.586
  },
  {
   "text": "Not a style choice.",
   "s": 44.04,
   "e": 45.095
  },
  {
   "text": "A lesson written in metal.",
   "s": 45.436,
   "e": 46.948
  }
 ]
}